<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0364_R25R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmm? You here for my grandson? His\nname Bill. THE Bill.\rHe in Johto. He do somethin’ with PCs.\nI don’t understand it. I’m\fhouse-sittin’.\fAnd eatin’ his food.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0364_R25R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ah, my grandson talked about a round,\nblue homie with leaves\fgrowin’ on its head.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0364_R25R0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bill told me about a homie that’s\nREAL loyal to its Hustler.\fIt’s a Fire-type homie that’s\fsupposed to Roar real good.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0364_R25R0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know that homie with big,\nround eyes?\rThe one that sing a lullaby with\nits cute lil voice!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0364_R25R0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know that SUPER popular\nhomie?\rThe one with the yellow body\nand bright red cheeks...\rI’d love to see what it look\nlike before it evolve.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0364_R25R0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I heard there’s a blue, round\nhomie in Johto.\rBill said the end of its tail\nwork like a float.\rIts belly white. Just the belly.\nI’d love to see it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0364_R25R0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My grandson Bill told me about a\nhomie with a long tongue.\rIt got ring marks on the front\nof its legs, he said!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0364_R25R0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ah, my grandson talked about a round,\nblue homie with leaves\fgrowin’ on its head.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0364_R25R0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know a sea homie that\ngot a red ball in its body?\fYou know, the one shaped like\fa star?\rI heard it come out at night.\nI’d sure like to see it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0364_R25R0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I heard about a cute homie that\ngot six tails.\rI’d love to hug a cute homie\nlike that.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0364_R25R0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know that SUPER popular\nhomie?\rThe one with the yellow body\nand bright red cheeks...\rI’d love to see what it look\nlike before it evolve.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0364_R25R0101_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you got that homie, can I see it,\nPLEASE? I’m old. Humor me. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0364_R25R0101_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You gon’ show me?\nThat’s so sweet!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0364_R25R0101_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You ain’t got it? That’s too bad... I\nmight not be around much longer, you\fknow.\fJK. I’m healthy as a horse.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0364_R25R0101_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hm?\rThat ain’t the homie I was\ntold about...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0364_R25R0101_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh!\nThat homie is called {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}!\rIt’s a wonderful homie!\nAs a thank-you,\fI wanna give you this!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0364_R25R0101_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Come back and visit\nsometime.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0364_R25R0101_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks for showin’ me so many\ncute homies.\rI DEADASS enjoyed myself. I’m glad I\nlived this long. And I’ma live\flonger. Outta spite.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0364_R25R0101_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s a dusty machine under the\ncloth...\fAin’t been used in a while.\fBill’s old teleporter. It ate a\nsandwich.</language>
	</row>
</body>
